[2026-03-14T19:33:21.514Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VSbb87GhJJLz7bCWANr71p","type":"tool_result","content":"761:- **Expected:** The page displays a message indicating the user is not a host (e.g., \"You need to become a host to access this page\") with a link or button to navigate to their profile page (`/profile`) where they can become a host.\n1089:## Page: User Profile (`/profile`)\n1097:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1098:- **Expected:** The user is redirected to `/login`. The profile page is not displayed.\n1102:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1103:- **Expected:** The profile form displays the current values: name \"Alice Smith\", email \"alice@example.com\" (read-only), bio \"Love traveling!\", phone \"555-1234\", and avatar URL \"https://example.com/avatar.jpg\". The avatar image is displayed using the URL.\n1106:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with name \"Alice Smith\".\n1111:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with bio \"Love traveling!\".\n1116:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with phone \"555-1234\".\n1121:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with avatar URL \"https://example.com/old-avatar.jpg\".\n1126:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile`.\n1131:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile`.\n1136:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with name \"Alice Smith\".\n1141:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with email \"alice@example.com\".\n1142:- **Action:** User views the profile form.\n1146:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on `/profile` with bio \"Old bio\".\n1147:- **Action:** User changes bio to \"New bio\", clicks \"Save\", then navigates to `/` (home page), then navigates back to `/profile`.\n1154:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1155:- **Expected:** A \"Become a Host\" button is visible on the profile page.\n1159:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1160:- **Expected:** The \"Become a Host\" button is NOT visible on the profile page.\n1163:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`.\n1165:- **Expected:** A confirmation dialog appears (e.g., \"Are you sure you want to become a host?\"). User confirms. A `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` request is sent. Upon success, the button disappears, a success message is shown (e.g., \"You are now a host!\"), and the Redux user state updates `is_host` to `true`. The \"Hosting\" link becomes available in the navigation sidebar.\n1168:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`. The \"Become a Host\" button is visible.\n1173:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`.\n1174:- **Action:** User views the profile page.\n1181:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1182:- **Expected:** A \"My Reviews\" section is visible showing all 3 reviews. Each review card displays: the property title, the overall rating (with filled/unfilled stars), the comment text, and the date the review was written.\n1186:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1191:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1201:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1205:- **Initial state:** User is logged in, on `/profile`, and has 2 existing reviews displayed.\n1206:- **Action:** User navigates to a completed booking, writes a new review, submits it, then navigates back to `/profile`.\n1207:- **Expected:** The \"My Reviews\" section now displays 3 reviews, including the newly written review with the correct property title, rating, and comment.\n1211:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1336:#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n1338:- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XeEJo91zX1zVTTDE8kgZQi","session_id":"428f3191-9775-460c-8316-8