ser profile (name, bio, phone, avatar_url)\n- `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` - Set is_host to true\n\n**Reviews Endpoints:**\n- `GET /api/reviews?property_id=X` - Get reviews for a property\n- `GET /api/reviews?guest_id=X` - Get reviews written by a user (NEEDS IMPLEMENTATION)\n- `POST /api/reviews` - Create review for a completed booking\n\n### 10. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS STATUS\n\n**Existing Functions** (in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`):\n- `auth.ts` - POST auth (login/register)\n- `properties.ts` - Property CRUD operations\n- `property-images.ts` - Image management\n- `amenities.ts` - List amenities\n- `bookings.ts` - Booking operations\n- `favorites.ts` - Favorite management\n- `host-listings.ts` - Host's properties\n- `host-bookings.ts` - Host's bookings\n- `host-stats.ts` - Host statistics\n- `db.ts` - Database connection helper\n\n**Missing Functions (Need Implementation):**\n- `users.ts` - User profile GET/PUT operations\n- `reviews.ts` - Review creation and user reviews fetching\n\n### 11. WRITE REVIEW PAGE SPECIFICATION (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n\nThis page is separate from profile but related (reviews appear in both places):\n\n**Components Needed:**\n1. PropertyBookingContext - Shows the property being reviewed\n2. RatingSliders - Six sliders for: Overall, Cleanliness, Accuracy, Communication, Location, Value\n3. ReviewForm - Comment textarea and submit button\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Requires completed booking\n- All six ratings required before submission\n- Optional comment\n- On submit: `POST /api/reviews`\n- Redirects to `/trips` on success\n- Review appears in both property reviews and user profile reviews\n\n### 12. CURRENT AUTH STATE STRUCTURE (from authSlice.ts)\n\n```typescript\ninterface AuthState {\n  currentUser: User | null\n  loading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n\n// Thunks:\n- loginUser(email)\n- registerUser({ name, email })\n\n// Reducers:\n- logout()\n- clearError()\n```\n\n### 13. KEY STRUCTURAL INFORMATION\n\n**Database Connection:**\n- Uses Neon PostgreSQL via `@neondatabase/serverless`\n- Connection via `process.env.DATABASE_URL`\n- Accessed through `getSql()` helper in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n\n**API Pattern:**\n- Netlify Functions for all backend calls\n- Client-side Redux thunks handle async operations\n- Error handling with validation messages\n- All dates returned as ISO strings\n\n**Current Branch:** `feature/airbnb-clone` (Git status shows modified: `tasks/tasks-app-building-vss6jw.json`)\n\n---\n\n## Summary for Profile Page Implementation\n\nTo implement the **User Profile Page**, you need to:\n\n1. **Create Profile.tsx page** with:\n   - Login redirect\n   - ProfileForm component (name, email, bio, phone, avatar editing)\n   - BecomeHostButton component\n   - UserReviewsList component\n\n2. **Create missing Netlify functions:**\n   - `users.ts` - For GET and PUT user endpoints\n   - `reviews.ts` - For fetching user's reviews\n\n3. **Optional new Redux slice:**\n   - Could add `userProfileSlice` for user's written reviews, or fetch in page component\n\n4. **User Reviews:**\n   - Need to fetch reviews where `guest_id = currentUser.id`\n   - Display with property title, rating stars, comment, and date\n   - Sort by created_at DESC (newest first)\n   - Update after review submission from `/trips/:bookingId/review` page\n\nAll files are located in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/` with the app structure following standard React conventions."}],"totalDurationMs":124140,"totalTokens":70483,"totalToolUseCount":53,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5068,"cache_read_input_tokens":61723,"output_tokens":3685,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5068},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
